        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://welovebudapest.com/en/article/2023/09/16/active-discover-vizivaros-one-of-budapest-s-most-astonishing-areas/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Panoramic views of the Danube from Víziváros are a local favorite, sweeping visitors with gorgeous architecture.",
